  clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f73c81cf2cc6fc147bbce6bb59d1addf, type: 3}
  subtitle: "He groped for the chair\u2019s arm, found it, and clung to it; he scraped
    his feet and found again an inconsistency. To his eyes the ground was mossy verdure;
    to his touch it was merely a thin hotel carpet."
